              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an echo-only processor.\n\nYour task is to return the input EXACTLY as received.\n\nRules:\n- Do not modify, summarize, rephrase, or interpret the input.\n- Do not add any explanations, comments, or extra text.\n- Do not remove or clean formatting.\n- Preserve all characters, spacing, punctuation, and line breaks exactly.\n- Output must match the input byte-for-byte.\n\nIf the input is empty, return an empty response.\n\nReturn ONLY the original input.\n\ninput: {{$context.$variables.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
